  "translation": "Mme Shaule a re: Kgaogang go ralala setshabeng, mme lo re bone: Ntlang kwano nna mongwe le mongwe tonki ya gagwe, mme mongwe le mongwe kwanyana ya gagwe, mme lo di bolaye fano, mme lo je; mme lo se ke la direla Yahwe boleo ka go ja mo mading. Mme setshaba sotlhe a ntsha mongwe le mongwe tonki ya gagwe ka letsogo la gagwe bosigo foo, mme ba di bolaya koo.",
